{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13105190","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13105190","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1310519001:1":{"text":"聞こえますか？ロンロンたちはカタストロフでも、悪い奴でもありません。","source_cn":"喂，你们能听到我讲话吗？我们不是恶魔，也不是坏人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0F8AE61C60130D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310519002:1":{"text":"二人が子どもを助けるのを見ました。あなたたちは真の英雄です！","source_cn":"我们都看到了，你们救了那两个小孩子，你们是英雄的战士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42F4BC19947B2DE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310519003:1":{"text":"彼らを、守……カタストロフと、戦う……","source_cn":"保护他们……和恶魔……战斗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBD4073F49034C02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310519004:1":{"text":"決して……逃げ、な……","source_cn":"绝不能……后退……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x180D8255E61EBFEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1310519004":{"text":"決して……逃げ、な……","source_cn":"绝不能……后退……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x180D8255E61EBFEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1310519005:1":{"text":"先ほど見た光景は、彼らが残した強い思いだったのですね。","source_cn":"我明白了，刚才看到的幻象就是他们强烈的执念所留存下来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A19B536FFCC6BED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310519006:1":{"text":"遠い昔に亡くなったのに、まだ子どもたちを守ろうと……","source_cn":"就算他们死去了那么久，也还想着要保护那些小孩子呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x425EA1E2D2C0CDFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1310519009:1":{"text":"死……？俺たちは……死んだ、のか？","source_cn":"死……我们……死了……？……我们……已经死了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5E2855BE8C3BD98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1310519010:1":{"text":"勝った、のか？カタストロフは……？","source_cn":"战争……胜利了吗？恶魔呢……恶魔……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0AED39B145B7BC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1310519011:1":{"text":"はい！勝ちました！カタストロフも封印されましたよ！","source_cn":"放心吧，你们胜利了！恶魔也被封印起来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14A033181A0E8182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1310519012:1":{"text":"それに二千年経った今も、ここの人たちは毎年祭典を開いて、あなたたちを讃えているんですよ。","source_cn":"而且就算过了两千年，这里的人们也没有忘记你们呢，他们每...","status":"matc